    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a 3D environment, in addition to stopping the enemy from advancing, you may also have to stop the enemy from rising or falling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use towers to block the enemy, but after the enemy gradually becomes stronger, it is better to build the tower on the roadside or wall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you choose to use low-level but massive towers to destroy the enemy, or use high-level and powerful towers to destroy the enemy, as long as you can stop the enemy, it is an excellent tactic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to powerful monsters, you also have to pay attention to small and fast-moving critters, but as long as you use towers that attack with a wide range, you don't have to worry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are still not satisfied, use the talent tree to strengthen your tower to an incredible level and make those guys despair!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next time, you have to be careful of them, they are attacking from all directions...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. The enemy is born at the green ball and goes to the end at the red ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Routes are randomly generated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Achieving achievement levels can increase the flow level of waves and challenge and defend more enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. There are multiple series of towers. Each series has three directions for advancement. After advancement, each series has three directions for strengthening. After advancement, there may be different abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. The talent points for strengthening the tower are calculated based on the highest number of kills in a single defense (not limited to levels).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. In addition to strengthening the tower's attack power, talents may also strengthen the tower's special abilities, and can also cause the tower's attacks to trigger debuff effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. Enemies may be large or small. Because the radius is calculated, the tower may only detect large enemies at the edge of the detection range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8. Enemies may be fast or slow, and non-pursuing bullets may hit enemies immediately behind the original target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9. The enemy may walk on the wall, and you can also build the tower on the wall, but be aware that ordinary bullets cannot penetrate the wall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a 3D environment, in addition to stopping the enemy from advancing, you may also have to stop the enemy from rising or falling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use towers to block the enemy, but after the enemy gradually becomes stronger, it is better to build the tower on the roadside or wall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you choose to use low-level but massive towers to destroy the enemy, or use high-level and powerful towers to destroy the enemy, as long as you can stop the enemy, it is an excellent tactic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to powerful monsters, you also have to pay attention to small and fast-moving critters, but as long as you use towers that attack with a wide range, you don't have to worry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are still not satisfied, use the talent tree to strengthen your tower to an incredible level and make those guys despair!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next time, you have to be careful of them, they are attacking from all directions...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. The enemy is born at the green ball and goes to the end at the red ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Routes are randomly generated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Achieving achievement levels can increase the flow level of waves and challenge and defend more enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. There are multiple series of towers. Each series has three directions for advancement. After advancement, each series has three directions for strengthening. After advancement, there may be different abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. The talent points for strengthening the tower are calculated based on the highest number of kills in a single defense (not limited to levels).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. In addition to strengthening the tower's attack power, talents may also strengthen the tower's special abilities, and can also cause the tower's attacks to trigger debuff effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. Enemies may be large or small. Because the radius is calculated, the tower may only detect large enemies at the edge of the detection range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8. Enemies may be fast or slow, and non-pursuing bullets may hit enemies immediately behind the original target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9. The enemy may walk on the wall, and you can also build the tower on the wall, but be aware that ordinary bullets cannot penetrate the wall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
